    "Is the \"exactly 150 hours per week\" requirement for Process I a hard requirement that the plan must satisfy (i.e., Process I must be fully utilized at its 150-hour capacity), or is it simply the maximum capacity that Process I cannot exceed?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the nature of the 150-hour constraint (hard requirement vs. maximum capacity)."
}

